---
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import '../../styles/help-situations.css';
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout bodyClass="site-refined"><Fragment slot="head"><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>How I can help you | Emma Siddons property search</title><meta name="description" content="See how I help you find and buy your next home: a clear brief, a focused property search, independent advice, negotiation and support through completion."><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="theme-color" content="#344d3d"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"><link rel="canonical" href="https://emma-siddons-admin.tight-darkness-d12f.workers.dev/how-i-can-help-you/"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Emma Siddons"><meta property="og:title" content="How I can help you | Emma Siddons property search"><meta property="og:description" content="See how I help you find and buy your next home: a clear brief, a focused property search, independent advice, negotiation and support through completion."><meta property="og:url" content="https://emma-siddons-admin.tight-darkness-d12f.workers.dev/how-i-can-help-you/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://emma-siddons-admin.tight-darkness-d12f.workers.dev/images/country-home.jpg"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="A stone country home and garden"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/BaseLayout.B6McQ5pf.css"></Fragment> <a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a> <SiteHeader />  <main id="main"><div data-retired> <section class="page-intro split-banner"> <div class="page-intro__copy"><p class="eyebrow">How I can help you</p><span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1>A clearer path to your next home.</h1><div class="page-intro__lead"><p>You may be short of time, moving to an unfamiliar area or simply struggling to find the right property. I bring a local perspective and a focused search to help you move forward.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Tell me about your plans<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></div> <div class="page-intro__media"><img src="/images/emma-research-960.webp" srcset="/images/emma-research-480.webp 480w, /images/emma-research-960.webp 960w, /images/emma-research-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Emma researching local information for a home search" width="1067" height="1600" fetchpriority="high"></div> </section> <section class="editorial editorial-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Working together</p><h2>Your priorities.<br>My attention.</h2><p>Every move is different. I tailor the search around you, offering a considered view of each opportunity and practical support at each stage.</p><p>As a buying agent, I work for you. My advice is independent of the seller and the selling agent.</p><a href="/services-and-fees/">Read about my service and fees →</a></div><ol class="numbered-list"><li><div><h3>First, I listen</h3><p>We talk about the home you want, the way you live and the areas you are considering. I help you turn your priorities into a clear search brief, including what you can be flexible about.</p></div></li><li><div><h3>I look beyond the listings</h3><p>I research the market and speak with local agents and contacts. Alongside publicly advertised homes, I look for opportunities being discussed privately or before they come to market.</p></div></li><li><div><h3>I help you make sense of the options</h3><p>I can preview homes to save you time and accompany you on viewings. We look carefully at the property, its setting and how well it meets your brief.</p></div></li><li><div><h3>I negotiate on your behalf</h3><p>When the right opportunity comes along, I help you assess it and negotiate the price and terms. I represent your interests throughout the conversation.</p></div></li><li><div><h3>I stay involved through completion</h3><p>I liaise with agents, solicitors and other professionals to help keep the purchase progressing. You have someone who knows your search alongside you through exchange and completion.</p></div></li></ol></section> <section class="contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title"> <div class="contact__copy"><h2 id="contact-title">Let’s talk about your next home</h2><p>Tell me what you are looking for, and I’ll explain how I can help.</p></div> <div class="contact__links"><a href="tel:+447702630983"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h4l2 5-3 2a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l2-3 5 2v4c0 1-1 2-2 2C10 21 3 14 3 5c0-1 1-2 2-2Z"></path></svg>07702 630983</a><a href="mailto:info@emmasiddons.com"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5h18v14H3ZM3 6l9 7 9-7"></path></svg>info@emmasiddons.com</a></div> </section> </div><div class="help-situations">
  <section class="s-hero">
    <div class="s-hero__copy reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">How I can help you</p>
      <span class="rule"></span>
      <h1>A clearer path to your next home.</h1>
      <p>You may be short of time, moving to an unfamiliar area or simply struggling to find the right property. I bring a local perspective and a focused search to help you move forward.</p>
      <div class="s-hero__actions">
        <a class="button" href="#talk">Tell me about your plans</a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="#situations">Which sounds like you?</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/help-situations-0.webp" alt="Emma researching local information for a home search" width="1000" height="1499" fetchpriority="high">
  </section>

  <section class="pick" id="situations" aria-labelledby="pick-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="pick__head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Room to think. Time to find.</p>
        <span class="rule"></span>
        <h2 id="pick-title">Which sounds like you?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="pick__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Your situation">
        <button class="pick__tab" role="tab" id="t-time" aria-controls="p-time" aria-selected="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="16"></circle><path d="M24 14v10l7 5"></path></svg><span>I’m short of time</span></button>
        <button class="pick__tab" role="tab" id="t-area" aria-controls="p-area" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 42s-13-12-13-22a13 13 0 0 1 26 0c0 10-13 22-13 22z"></path><circle cx="24" cy="20" r="5"></circle></svg><span>I’m new to the area</span></button>
        <button class="pick__tab" role="tab" id="t-find" aria-controls="p-find" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="12"></circle><path d="m30 30 10 10"></path></svg><span>The right home hasn’t appeared</span></button>
        <button class="pick__tab" role="tab" id="t-quiet" aria-controls="p-quiet" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 24s7-12 18-12 18 12 18 12-7 12-18 12S6 24 6 24z"></path><path d="M8 40 40 8"></path></svg><span>I’d rather keep my search low-key</span></button>
        <button class="pick__tab" role="tab" id="t-deal" aria-controls="p-deal" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 30 16 20l8 4 8-8 10 10"></path><path d="M6 40h36"></path></svg><span>I want someone to negotiate for me</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="pick__panel is-showing" role="tabpanel" id="p-time" aria-labelledby="t-time">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Time saved</p><h3>House hunting is hugely time-consuming.</h3><p>I research your search area, liaise with agents and preview properties on your behalf, so you can focus on the homes worth a closer look.</p><p>I accompany you to viewings with a realistic commentary, vision and ideas.</p><ul><li>Search area researched for you</li><li>Properties previewed on your behalf</li><li>The purchase managed through exchange and completion</li></ul></div>
        <img src="/images/help-situations-1.webp" alt="Emma outside a country house with her tablet" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="668">
      </div>
      <div class="pick__panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-area" aria-labelledby="t-area" hidden="">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Local knowledge and vision</p><h3>Look beyond a postcode.</h3><p>I have lived locally for more than 40 years. I know the villages, the communities, the schools, the commute, the shops and definitely the pubs and restaurants.</p><p>I cut through the marketing to see what a property really is and imagine what it could become. I also understand the practical issues that come with country homes:</p><ul><li>Listed buildings</li><li>Land boundaries and classifications</li><li>Off-mains drainage and public footpaths</li></ul></div>
        <img src="/images/help-situations-2.webp" alt="Much Hadham village sign beside a traditional house" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="669">
      </div>
      <div class="pick__panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-find" aria-labelledby="t-find" hidden="">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Access to off-market homes</p><h3>Some doors open through a conversation.</h3><p>Not every home appears on a property portal. I work hard to find homes being sold “off” or “pre” market: through word of mouth, my existing relationships with other agents and direct approaches to homeowners.</p><p>Off-market availability varies, so I cannot promise a particular home will be available.</p></div>
        <img src="/images/help-situations-3.webp" alt="A country house beyond a pond and a tree-lined garden" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="666">
      </div>
      <div class="pick__panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-quiet" aria-labelledby="t-quiet" hidden="">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Independence and discretion</p><h3>On your side, and discreet.</h3><p>Selling agents serve the needs of sellers, not buyers. As an independent buying agent I have complete autonomy from selling agents, and I look out for you and you alone.</p><p>If you would rather remain anonymous or keep your search low-key, I offer complete discretion.</p></div>
        <img src="/images/help-situations-4.webp" alt="Emma Siddons outdoors in Hertfordshire" loading="lazy" style="object-position:50% 30%" width="1000" height="668">
      </div>
      <div class="pick__panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-deal" aria-labelledby="t-deal" hidden="">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Negotiation</p><h3>Someone clear-headed in your corner.</h3><p>I help negotiate the best possible deal, potentially saving many multiples of my fee.</p><p>When you fall in love with a home, you are not best placed to negotiate on your own behalf. I understand the local market and the value of a local property.</p><p>I research a seller’s motivation and pressure points to help secure the best price and terms, and I know when it is time to walk away.</p></div>
        <img src="/images/help-situations-5.webp" alt="Emma Siddons seated on a leather sofa with her laptop" loading="lazy" style="object-position:30% 50%" width="1000" height="668">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stepper" aria-labelledby="stepper-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stepper__head reveal">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Working together</p><span class="rule"></span><h2 id="stepper-title">Your priorities. My attention.</h2></div>
        <p>Every move is different. I tailor the search around you, offering a considered view of each opportunity and practical support at each stage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stepper__nav" role="tablist" aria-label="Steps">
        <button class="stepper__btn" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="s1" id="b1"><b>01</b><span>First, I listen</span></button>
        <button class="stepper__btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="s2" id="b2" tabindex="-1"><b>02</b><span>I look beyond the listings</span></button>
        <button class="stepper__btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="s3" id="b3" tabindex="-1"><b>03</b><span>I help you make sense of the options</span></button>
        <button class="stepper__btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="s4" id="b4" tabindex="-1"><b>04</b><span>I negotiate on your behalf</span></button>
        <button class="stepper__btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="s5" id="b5" tabindex="-1"><b>05</b><span>I stay involved through completion</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="stepper__panel" role="tabpanel" id="s1" aria-labelledby="b1"><span class="stepper__num" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>First, I listen</h3><p>We talk about the home you want, the way you live and the areas you are considering. I help you turn your priorities into a clear search brief, including what you can be flexible about.</p></div></div>
      <div class="stepper__panel" role="tabpanel" id="s2" aria-labelledby="b2" hidden=""><span class="stepper__num" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>I look beyond the listings</h3><p>I research the market and speak with local agents and contacts. Alongside publicly advertised homes, I look for opportunities being discussed privately or before they come to market.</p></div></div>
      <div class="stepper__panel" role="tabpanel" id="s3" aria-labelledby="b3" hidden=""><span class="stepper__num" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>I help you make sense of the options</h3><p>I can preview homes to save you time and accompany you on viewings. We look carefully at the property, its setting and how well it meets your brief, and I give you a realistic commentary, vision and ideas.</p></div></div>
      <div class="stepper__panel" role="tabpanel" id="s4" aria-labelledby="b4" hidden=""><span class="stepper__num" aria-hidden="true">04</span><div><h3>I negotiate on your behalf</h3><p>When the right opportunity comes along, I help you assess it and negotiate the price and terms. I research the seller’s motivation and pressure points, and I represent your interests throughout the conversation.</p></div></div>
      <div class="stepper__panel" role="tabpanel" id="s5" aria-labelledby="b5" hidden=""><span class="stepper__num" aria-hidden="true">05</span><div><h3>I stay involved through completion</h3><p>I liaise with agents, solicitors and other professionals to help keep the purchase progressing. You have someone who knows your search alongside you through exchange and completion.</p></div></div>
      <div class="stepper__controls">
        <button type="button" data-step="-1" aria-label="Previous step"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12H5m6-6-6 6 6 6"></path></svg></button>
        <button type="button" data-step="1" aria-label="Next step"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="indie" aria-label="Independent advice">
    <div class="wrap indie__inner reveal">
      <p>As a buying agent, I work for you. My advice is independent of the seller and the selling agent.</p>
      <a class="button" href="/services-and-fees/">Read about my service and fees <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="talk" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
    <div class="wrap reveal">
      <h2 id="cta-title">Let’s talk about your next home.</h2>
      <p>Tell me what you are looking for, and I’ll explain how I can help.</p>
      <div class="cta__actions">
        <a class="button" href="tel:+447702630983">07702 630983</a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="mailto:info@emmasiddons.com">info@emmasiddons.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div></main> <SiteFooter /> <script>import '../../scripts/help-situations';</script></SiteLayout>